<title>HUNGARY: CESI ends at 1,491.72 points, virtually steady.</title>
<headline>CESI ends at 1,491.72 points, virtually steady.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index edged up 0.73 points or 0.05 percent on Tuesday to close at 1,491.72 points, the Budapest Stock Exchange said on its Reuters page  .CESI.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
